config BR2_PACKAGE_ES_THEME_ART_BOOK_NEXT
	bool "es-theme-art-book-next"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_EMULATIONSTATION
	help
	  Art Book Next, a theme for EmulationStation: system artwork
	  and logos, game list layouts for every common aspect ratio
	  (including the 4:3 and 1:1 handheld panels), and menu
	  sounds. Without a theme the frontend falls back to its plain
	  built-in layout of system names.

	  Only the default system artwork set is installed; the other
	  five sets in the theme add about 250 MB.

	  https://github.com/anthonycaccese/art-book-next-es
